  "description": "Artaroko – Handwritten Brush Font\nArtaroko is a handwritten brush font designed with bold strokes and authentic hand-painted textures. Inspired by street art and urban culture, this grunge brush font brings raw energy and fearless expression into your design projects.\nWith its all-caps style, Artaroko is perfect as a display font for impactful headlines, bold quotes, and statement branding. The rough edges and textured details make it an excellent choice for those looking for a street style font or graffiti brush font that feels real, energetic, and handcrafted.\nBest For:\n– Urban branding & streetwear designs\n– Music covers, festival & gig posters\n– Graffiti-inspired artwork\n– Bold social media graphics\n– Logos, apparel & merchandise.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Artaroko – Handwritten Brush Font</p>\n<p>Artaroko is a handwritten brush font designed with bold strokes and authentic hand-painted textures. Inspired by street art and urban culture, this grunge brush font brings raw energy and fearless expression into your design projects.</p>\n<p>With its all-caps style, Artaroko is perfect as a display font for impactful headlines, bold quotes, and statement branding. The rough edges and textured details make it an excellent choice for those looking for a street style font or graffiti brush font that feels real, energetic, and handcrafted.</p>\n<p>Best For:<br>\n– Urban branding &amp; streetwear designs<br>\n– Music covers, festival &amp; gig posters<br>\n– Graffiti-inspired artwork<br>\n– Bold social media graphics<br>\n– Logos, apparel &amp; merchandise.</p>",
